==Description==
The '''Valentines Crate''' is an exclusive [[Crates|crate]] that was added to celebrate Valentine's Day 2020. This crate gives Valentine-themed skins that produces heart particles when placed. It could have been purchased for {{Coins|2,500}} from the store.

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Valentines Crate''' resembles the look of an pink, yellow and red wooden box which was sealed shut. It contains gold on the inside. On its top is the standard shipping symbol indicating which side is up while on the front it had a heart. It was opened with a crowbar.
|Version 2
|The current appearance is similar to the [[Basic Crate]]. It is a pink cardboard box with  pink tape and a Cupid symbol on the side.
|Version 1
|The original crate was in the shape of a pink heart, with a red bow-tie on top.
}}

