==Trivia==
*In the [[v1.6.0|Violent Night Update]] the skins from the [[Season of Love]] were added to the '''Valentines Crate''', despite the crate being unobtainable. This was most likely a bug.
**Later in the [[v1.6.2|Valentines 2023 Update]], these skins would be moved into the [[Lovely Crate]]. Weirdly, the {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Sniper]] skin was also moved there.

